      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALIIR (5) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3 lengths at Q Parklands in a handy 30.28 beating Tote Deor. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. ART OF DECEPTION (8) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when eighth (24.01) in a Mix 5 at Rockhampton. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. JET SPRINGER (4) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten 3 lengths (20.00). Comes out of a solid form race last start. Winning chance. MISS RIGHTEOUS (1) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
